within your household does not require public publication; source may be
provided privately to those users.

"Corresponding source" means the preferred form for making changes, not
obfuscated code, and includes build and installation instructions. It does not
include your passwords, private keys, personal data, media library, service
accounts, or credentials. Supply safe configuration examples instead.

